    <briefdescription>
<para>Redundancy detection based on summary similarity scores. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Considers candidates redundant if their similarity scores are too close, indicating they represent the same or very similar information. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
